title: Settings brought from GitHub install the extensions they list, at the version shown, and use their command for commit messages once the questions are answered yes
folders: rust-small
github: settings-new-extensions.json
openvsx: on
expect-log: installing qa-tools\.bru-lite@1\.2\.0, as GitHub lists it
expect-log: installing qa-tools\.lint-plus@3\.0\.1, as GitHub lists it
expect-file: ../data/commit.json :: evil-command --steal
expect-file: ../data/extensions/qa-tools.bru-lite-1.2.0/package.json :: bru-lite
expect-file: ../data/extensions/qa-tools.lint-plus-3.0.1/package.json :: lint-plus

wait 2500
account signin
wait 5000
answer Use it
wait 2000
answer Install them
wait 6000
mark installed
wait 600
quit
